          "userId": "eid_890654c4",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-11T10:30:00",
          "text": "Thanks for the feedback, @Ian Garcia, @Fiona Martinez, and Ian Brown! 😊 I'll add more technical details to the 'Product Features' section and include some case studies in 'Market Opportunities'. For the 'Challenges and Risks', I'll expand on change management strategies. Does that sound good to everyone?",
